return {
    ["2级封印物，仲裁人途径遗物。\n能在特定范围内颁布临时律令，强制目标遵守。\n律令本是枷锁，经贿赂者之手变成了礼物。 \n信众以为自己获得了保护，红线却已成形。\n这就是金狼护盾的力量来源。"] = "Level 2 Sealed Artifact, a relic of the Arbiter pathway. \n Can issue temporary decrees within a specific range, forcing targets to comply. \n The decree was originally a shackle, but through the hands of a briber, it became a gift. \n The believers thought they had gained protection, but the red line had already formed. \n This is the source of the Golden Wolf Shield's power.",
