    ["<Assistant_Title1>【俱乐部】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开放等级：</>认知等级<Assistant_Red>20级</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-俱乐部</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250052}\n<Assistant_Title2>系统介绍：</>角色等级到达20级，可以选择加入俱乐部或自行创建俱乐部。参与各种俱乐部活动玩法，获取丰厚的活动奖励和同行纹章，同行纹章可在俱乐部商店中兑换奖励道具。\n<Assistant_Title2>创建俱乐部：</>创建俱乐部需要缴纳创建费用，创建后24小时内响应人数达到4人则创建成功，超时将创建失败。<Assistant_Red>创建失败和主动取消创建，都不会返还创建费用。</>\n<Assistant_Title2>俱乐部类型：</>俱乐部分为休闲俱乐部和战斗俱乐部，可在俱乐部信息修改处进行调整，休闲俱乐部不会在成员列表显示非凡评分。\n<Assistant_Title2>改名道具：</>可在<Assistant_System>商城 - 秘藏陈列</>中购买更名布告，更改俱乐部的名称和徽章字。\n<Assistant_Title2>活动限制：</>1.俱乐部成员锁定规则：在以俱乐部为单位的玩法活动（如<Assistant_System>四方联赛、歌剧魅影、猎城战、高原战</>）期间，俱乐部<Assistant_Red>不允许成员的加入和退出。</>\n2.俱乐部活动途径人数限制：部分俱乐部活动对参与成员的<Assistant_Red>途径人数</>有限制要求，详情可见俱乐部活动说明。\n3.参与活动前请先确认职位分配情况，<Assistant_Red>部分活动仅支持正式会员参赛</>，正式会员是俱乐部的中坚力量，可以参与俱乐部内的玩法活动；候补成员是俱乐部的储备力量，部分俱乐部活动无法参与，可以保持活跃状态，联系管理转正为会员。\n<Assistant_Title3>基础功能细节规则：</>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部建筑和资金]|1401}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部职位]|1402}，{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃]|1403}，{SendAnswer:[场景-俱乐部]|567}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>20</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250052}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>Once your character reaches level 20, you can choose to join a club or create your own. Participate in various club activities to earn rich rewards and Companion Emblems, which can be exchanged for reward items in the Club Shop.\n<Assistant_Title2>Creating a Club: </>Creating a club requires a fee. If at least 4 people respond within 24 hours of creation, the club is successfully established; otherwise, it will fail.<Assistant_Red>The creation fee is not refunded if the creation fails or is voluntarily canceled.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Types: </>Clubs are divided into Leisure Clubs and Competition Clubs, which can be adjusted in the Club Information settings. Leisure Clubs do not display Beyonder ratings in the member list.\n<Assistant_Title2>Renaming Items: </>You can purchase a Renaming Notice in the <Assistant_System>Mall - Treasure Display </> to change the club's name and emblem text.\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Restrictions: </>1. Club Member Lock Rule: During club-based activities (such as <Assistant_System>Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, Hunting City Battle, Highland Battle</>), clubs <Assistant_Red>do not allow members to join or leave.</>\n2. Club Activity Pathway Participation Limits: Some club activities have requirements for the number of participants from specific <Assistant_Red>Pathways</>; see the club activity instructions for details.\n3. Please confirm position assignments before participating in activities, as <Assistant_Red>some activities only support official members participating</>. Official members are the backbone of the club and can participate in all club activities; reserve members are the club's backup force and cannot participate in some activities. You can maintain an active status and contact management to be promoted to an official member.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[Club - Club Buildings and Funds]|1401}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Positions]|1402}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}, {SendAnswer:[Scene - Club]|567}",
